    "intro": {
      "zh": "Nintendo GameCube 是任天堂 2001 年发布的第六代家用游戏机，是任天堂首台采用光盘介质的主机，以方块机身、顶部提手与 miniDVD 光驱展开差异化探索。它在与 PS2、Xbox 的第六代竞争中独树一帜，是游戏机厅第六代主机「迷你 DVD 差异化探索」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Nintendo GameCube, released by Nintendo in 2001, was a sixth-generation home console and Nintendo's first to use optical-disc media, exploring differentiation with its cube design, top handle, and miniDVD drive."
    },
    "era": 2001,
    "manufacturer": "Nintendo"
  },
